WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:06.950
<i>As second-in-command of the Dark Realm, 
the Great Jahy did as she pleased</i>

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.070
<i>and all trembled before her...</i>

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:12.980
<i>in the past!</i>

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.840
I don't have to work today.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.090
Maybe I'll take a nice, relaxing bath.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:33.010
How the hell am I supposed to relax 
in this pathetic little tub?!

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:48.330
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:49.130
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:49.920
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:50.630
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:51.420
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:53.370
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:08.480
<b>Restoration Plan No. 8

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.830
I'm starving...

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:18.540
I've come to pick you up, Your Greatness.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:21.260
Who're you?

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:24.980
I am President Dojima's chauffeur.

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:26.310
Dojima?

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:28.830
Oh, you mean Druj?

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:32.160
After you.

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:34.670
The president is waiting.

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.300
She is?

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.550
What's this all of a sudden?

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:47.310
Please help yourself to some
refreshments, Your Greatness.

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:52.150
An all-you-can-eat sweets buffet?

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:55.360
What service from Druj today!

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:03.130
What's this?

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:16.300
Wow, now that's nice!

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:23.390
<i>With all these snacks, 
I could live it up for a while.</i>

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:25.780
<i>I want to move in here!</i>

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:28.850
We've arrived.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:31.350
Already? No!

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.480
President Dojima is waiting for you.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:37.320
I don't care! I live here now!

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:38.440
Your Greatness...

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:44.620
No way, no how! 
This is my home now! I live here!

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:50.060
O Great Jahy! I've been waiting for you.

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:51.910
Welcome to my company.

00:03:52.130 --> 00:03:53.010
Your company?

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:53.890
That's right!

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:55.380
This is my company.

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:59.960
Druj... or rather, Dojima Corporation!

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.980
I believe when I visited your workplace last,

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:08.780
I invited you to come here to mine.

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:10.310
Did you?

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:12.450
A draft beer, please!

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:17.080
And I really hope you'll visit me
 at my company, too, Your Greatness!

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:18.050
Coming right up!

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:20.320
One draft beer and one company visit, please!

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:22.030
So you did...

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:26.580
I sincerely apologize for summoning 
 you when you're so busy,

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:32.200
but I'm in dire need of your help today.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:37.130
I am busy. I don't have time to waste here.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:38.920
Please find it in your heart.

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:43.470
This is a job only you, the Dark Realm's
second-in-command, could handle.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.880
<i>Only you, the Dark Realm's
 second-in-command...</i>

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:49.710
<i>Only you, the Dark Realm's 
second-in-command.</i>

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:53.000
<i>Only you, the Dark Realm's 
second-in-command!</i>

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.810
Wh-What would you do without me?

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.150
Fine. The Dark Realm's 
second-in-command will help you out.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:05.340
Then let us have some tea
 and discuss the matter right away.

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:17.590
So what does your company do, anyway?

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:21.300
Our company is a so-called 
management consultancy.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.760
"Consommé tart"?

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:28.830
Companies come to us for advice.
 We analyze their financial situations,

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:32.010
or even offer insight on how 
to improve their businesses.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:36.420
Put simply, we take advantage 
of these greedy lower lifeforms

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:39.570
and suck out that sweet nectar 
called a consultancy fee.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:44.510
For a demon, this profession
is our true calling!

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:46.720
C-Calm down, Druj...

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:46.720
True calling...

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:49.160
Oh, do pardon me.

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:55.530
At any rate, my experience from the 
Dark Realm has proven extremely useful.

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:58.730
Of course, it's all thanks to you!

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:04.360
Not only did you see my abilities, 
you also believed in me

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:07.880
and entrusted various duties to me.

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:12.520
You are the greatest teacher!
The best master!

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:18.280
I'm glad you see things how they are, Druj.

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:22.960
Now, why don't you tell me what you need
the Dark Realm's second-in-command for?

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:31.230
Actually, we're having a special training 
seminar for all company employees.

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:32.260
Sure, sure.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:37.100
I'd be honored if someone as
overflowing with charisma as you

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:39.540
would speak at the event.

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:42.680
Charisma? I like the sound of that.

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.830
Upsy!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.830
Long live the Great Jahy!

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:46.260
Upsy!

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:46.260
Long live the Great Jahy!

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:48.370
Would that be possible?

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:49.490
No problem.

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:51.340
Oh, thank you so much!

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:53.620
Please, just step right this way.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:54.520
Sure.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:57.270
Pardon me while I take your clothes.

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:57.930
Sure.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.140
<i>That's right.</i>

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:05.010
<i>That job and that ratty apartment 
aren't where I belong.</i>

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:07.940
<i>I have a place...</i>

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:10.450
<i>A place worthy of me!</i>

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:12.820
It's just about time.

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:14.080
Right this way, please.

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:20.040
And now, I would like to welcome to the 
stage the person who I admire most!

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:25.110
Meet the Great Jahy,
 owner of the Maou Pub!

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:37.340
<i>Hark the story of the 
Dark Realm's second-in-command!</i>

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:41.810
Well met, humans.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:45.360
When I was in the Dark Realm, 
power was everything!

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.650
I see!

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:49.110
In our current society, 
what we need is power!

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.770
In other words, financial power!

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:53.130
And capable people!

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:54.740
That's what you mean, right?

00:07:57.780 --> 00:07:59.910
I'd expect no less from you!

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:06.610
I'm so sorry, Your Greatness!

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:08.670
I just got so excited...

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:10.920
Don't worry about it.

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:14.450
So, in my opinion...

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:17.340
Those on top need to recognize 
their underlings' talents

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:20.890
and create an environment where 
they can thrive and work freely!

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:23.100
That's what you're saying, right?!

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.480
Wow!

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:27.080
Amazing!

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:28.440
Makes sense!

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:30.980
I...

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:32.820
It's just as you say!

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:37.560
The ideal superior is someone like you,

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:40.740
who trusts their underlings and guides them!

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:46.170
They must know when to be tough. 
When to treat you to a meal.

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:48.990
Communication between ranks is so important.

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:52.020
Indeed, we mustn't forget that 
the superior-underling relationship

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:58.220
is a bond every bit as important
as that of family and lovers.

00:08:58.770 --> 00:09:01.310
That's what you wanted to say, right?!

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:08.630
Thank you!

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:10.920
Let's show our appreciation 
for the Great Jahy!

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:22.050
Thank you for that amazing speech today.

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:24.790
I was so moved.

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:27.180
You can let me out here.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:30.250
But why don't we drop you off at your domicile?

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:33.580
There's somewhere I'd like to stop by.

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:35.340
Oh, I see...

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:37.550
Please pull over, then.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:38.990
Certainly.

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:54.840
You did all of the talking!

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:57.530
That was supposed to be my moment!

00:09:57.730 --> 00:10:00.320
My time in the limelight!

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:03.230
Druj, you dolt!

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:16.000
I forgot to tell you, 
but as thanks for today,

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:19.220
I'd like to invite you to a party.

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:21.680
Did you say... a party?

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:26.100
That's right! I'll pick you up next weekend.

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:27.570
S-Sure.

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:39.990
<b>Craft Pub <b>Maou.</b></b>

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:47.290
My, Hy-chan, you're in a good mood.

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:49.000
Did something good happen?

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:51.570
Druj invited me to a party.

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:52.710
A party?

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:57.550
It's her way of saying thanks
for me helping her out.

00:10:57.780 --> 00:11:01.210
Wow! I'm sure it'll be amazing.

00:11:01.210 --> 00:11:04.260
Druj-chan is a company president, after all.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.970
You've got to dress up for it, okay?

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:08.750
Maybe do something with your hair.

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:12.890
Hy-chan, are you bathing regularly?

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:14.270
Rude!

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:16.290
I bathe once every three days!

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.010
Once every three days?

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:19.250
In a washtub...

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:20.570
A washtub?!

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:23.620
What else am I supposed to do? 
There's no bath at my place!

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:28.510
Hy-chan, we'll go when work is over.

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:29.730
Huh?

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:30.870
Go where?

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:32.870
Somewhere nice.

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:38.590
What's so nice about this place?

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:40.420
Just looks like some old-ass building.

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:41.610
It's a place to bathe.

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:43.380
A public bathhouse.

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:45.040
Why the hell did I have to come?

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:46.040
A bath?

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:47.220
Here?

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:48.600
Let's go on in.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:51.020
<b>Bathhouse Admission
Adults          500 yen
Students       400 yen
Children       300 yen</b>

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.260
Hurry up now!

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:57.290
One child.

00:11:57.290 --> 00:11:59.030
Thank you. Go on in.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:00.990
That's convenient.

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:03.320
You jealous?

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:05.530
No, not really.

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:11.000
I paid 300 yen for this, 
so it'd better be good.

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:26.800
Hey, stop switching back and forth
between being big and small.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:27.670
Oh?

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:31.000
Jealous of my beautiful body?

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.310
Not really. Stop taunting me.

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:36.900
Ryou-chan, are you still 
concerned about your chest?

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:39.270
You used to drink those supplements,

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:41.380
but I thought you'd 
stopped worrying these days...

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:42.400
Sis!

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:44.750
So the bath is this way, is it?

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:50.450
Well, compared to the Dark Realm, 
this shabby place can't possibly be—

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:51.790
It's huge!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.710
Nice, isn't it?

00:12:57.260 --> 00:13:00.800
Well, size isn't all that matters.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:05.720
Man, I haven't had hot water in forever!

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:08.930
Hy-chan, I'll wash your back for you.

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:13.820
Does anywhere itch?

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:16.460
A little to the left.

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:17.850
That's it, that's it...

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:24.320
<i>Between the nice lather and the boss's 
scrubbing technique, this isn't bad at all!</i>

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:27.270
Do my arms next.

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:28.500
Yes, yes.

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:32.080
Hey, Sis, don't spoil Ja-ko so much.

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:33.910
Jealous?

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:35.880
Not really.

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:37.710
I used to do this for you, too, remember?

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:42.590
Up until you started middle school.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:43.780
Sis!

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:44.960
Ooh, what's this?

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:47.050
Can't stand seeing me steal your sister?

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:48.440
You...

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:50.200
What a child!

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:54.680
Says the person enjoying 
being bathed like one!

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:58.270
You'll have to excuse me, little baby.
I need to go wash my hair.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:05.910
Compared to what we had in the Dark Realm, 
this human shampoo can't possibly—

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:11.700
How does it smell so good?!

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:16.000
It's so silky to the touch, too.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.870
I never knew the humans 
had anything like this.

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.280
It's complimentary, too!

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:23.640
This bathhouse is pretty great.

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:28.070
<i>My hair is happy, too!</i>

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:32.180
<i>Wait, wait, wait. We're just getting started.</i>

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:34.030
<i>The water makes or breaks a bath.</i>

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:36.850
<i>That'll determine whether
 this place is good or—</i>

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:40.310
<i>Wow, it's the ideal temperature!</i>

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:42.630
<i>I've even got plenty 
of room to stretch my legs.</i>

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:49.240
<i>I don't get how, but these bubbles are 
perfectly massaging my sore shoulders.</i>

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:54.020
<i>This place is really the best.</i>

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:56.330
<i>The vast, infinite hot water...</i>

00:14:56.810 --> 00:14:58.890
<i>The tub big enough to stretch out in...</i>

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:01.890
<i>The wonderful-smelling shampoo...</i>

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:04.900
<i>I never thought the humans 
had baths this nice.</i>

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:25.410
You shrunk again, Ja-ko!

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:28.900
I thought I told you not to do that here.

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:30.150
Don't ignore me!

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:33.420
Looks like you're all done now, too.

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.200
Why don't I dry your hair for you?

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.830
You're still babying her!

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.410
Oh, just let me.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:42.520
We came together after all, you know?

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:43.550
I swear...

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:46.570
Isn't it nice here, Hy-chan?

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:50.790
It's close to the pub and it's cheap,  
so the two of us come here often.

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:55.060
For you.

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:57.890
Milk after you get out 
is the crowning touch.

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:01.850
Hey, why didn't you tell me 
about this place earlier?!

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:05.310
Oh, I didn't know you didn't know about it.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:08.310
As the landlord, you should have told me!

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:12.010
I'm living in your shitty bathless apartment!

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:14.740
Aw, don't sweat the small stuff.

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:16.450
Damn you...

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:18.880
That's good!

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:29.950
We should all do this again soon, Hy-chan.

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:33.080
Y-Yeah, I guess so.

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:38.810
<i>The milk after the bath was so delicious 
that the Great Jahy forgave everything.</i>

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:47.750
Are you ready, Your Greatness?

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:48.610
Indeed.

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:55.820
We are both sick of having to spend 
our days in this human world.

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:57.210
Yes, yes.

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:58.660
That is no surprise.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.580
We are inhabitants of the Dark Realm.

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:01.540
Yes, yes...

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:06.930
While we cannot immediately restore 
the Dark Realm, this is a special night.

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:09.250
So let us begin...

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.180
the Dark Realm party!

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:12.710
Yeah!

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:17.050
I've prepared a variety of delights for you!

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:18.680
Oh, wow!

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:20.600
Dishes from the Dark Realm!

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:24.000
I tried recreating them 
with ingredients from the human world.

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:29.320
Wow, it tastes just like the real thing!

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:31.520
Your Greatness! Your Greatness!

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:36.950
This is awful!

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.780
You eat it!

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:42.370
Oh, you've made me so happy!

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:44.210
Ah, this takes me back!

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:45.830
I've missed it so!

00:17:48.640 --> 00:17:51.510
Your Greatness, please take a look at this!

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:55.300
It's Yaku! And Nostar!

00:17:55.460 --> 00:17:57.360
I haven't seen them in forever.

00:17:57.360 --> 00:18:00.990
I made these dolls to look
just like your old underlings.

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:02.260
Druj!

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:03.720
The decorations...

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:04.930
The food...

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:07.100
Our brethren!

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:15.710
<i>O Great Jahy! O Great Jahy!</i>

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:20.770
I'm really back in the Dark Realm!

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:24.740
<i>Dojima-san?</i>

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:26.020
<i>Delivery for you.</i>

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:27.960
C-Coming!

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:30.580
Just sign right here, please.

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:33.920
Druj...

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:37.010
Can't you read the room?

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:39.490
This is a special Dark Realm night!

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:42.460
You said so yourself, didn't you?!

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:44.470
Please accept my apologies!

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:48.730
Anything that reminds me 
of the human world is forbidden.

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:50.060
Understood?

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:51.560
As you wish!

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:52.520
Hup!

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:57.650
Now then, let's shake that off and...

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.290
Very good, very good.

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:03.620
Your Greatness!

00:19:06.570 --> 00:19:08.280
Yes? Dojima here.

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:13.260
I believe I asked you to take care of that.

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:14.740
Yes.

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:17.120
I will.

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:18.370
Thank you.

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:19.440
Goodbye.

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:28.850
Druj...

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:32.190
My humblest apologies!

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:33.630
This stupid thing!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:36.590
Take that!

00:19:36.590 --> 00:19:37.470
And that!

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:38.900
And that, too!

00:19:41.900 --> 00:19:45.740
Now, Your Greatness, 
shall we pick up where we left off?

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:47.270
Yeah, sure.

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.210
<i>I've missed this.</i>

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.300
<i>I've really missed this.</i>

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:58.910
<i>My Dark Realm...</i>

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:15.850
What's that noise?

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:18.090
The clock striking midnight.

00:20:18.090 --> 00:20:19.400
Midnight?

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:23.780
I need to get home.

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:27.240
But we haven't had
 the special Dark Realm cake yet!

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:34.580
<i>It was such a good Dark Realm party, 
I want to leave it in this form.</i>

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:36.760
Your Greatness?

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:38.830
I had fun.

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:41.430
Next time, let's do it
 in the Dark Realm for real.

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:43.050
Y-Your Greatness?

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:18.160
I want to go home to the Dark Realm already!

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:23.260
I swear I'll get those mana crystals!

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:26.750
And defeat that magical girl!

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:32.280
And one day, I'll move to 
a place with an actual bath!

00:21:32.800 --> 00:21:35.570
Because I'm... the one and only...

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:40.800
Great Jahy, second-in-command
 of the Dark Realm!

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:39.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:39.020
<b>Saurva Can't Catch A Break...</b>
